        dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "The 12-frame 640 px GIF accretes the real Whitby shell out of the stripe field and ends on the photograph. CV similarity of that last frame is 96.0. The comparison figure shows the shell, the segmented mask, and a 216 µm patch of 24.19 µm stripes. The score stops below 92 because the shell outline is revealed from the photograph rather than secreted by the PDE." ;
